        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ben Queen, Rashida Jones, Will McCormack, Lenora Crichlow, Chuck Bartowski\n- TV series: A to Z, Parks and Recreation, Back in the Game, Chuck\n- Companies: Warner Bros., NBC, ABC\n- Roles: executive producer, Ann Perkins\n\nFacts:\n- Ben Queen created the American romantic comedy television series A to Z.\n- Ben Queen, Rashida Jones, and Will McCormack served as executive producers of A to Z for Warner Bros.\n- Rashida Jones is widely known for playing Ann Perkins on NBC's comedy Parks and Recreation, and she received acclaim for that role.\n- Lenora Crichlow later had regular roles in the ABC sitcom Back in the Game and the NBC comedy series A to Z.\n- Chuck Bartowski, whose full name is Charles Irving Bartowski, is the main title character of the American spy show Chuck on NBC.",
